      "notes": "T-syr-base (atlas-team, 2026-11-20), audits AUDIT-1 major (an accidental bold mark on lem:base, fixed in round 1) and AUDIT-2 clean. Partial: a finding on the printed text; the strongest true form is proved, unmarked.",
